Subject: Say TacetOS in plugin texts and rename the titles of the renamed plugins

Help and menu texts of the kept plugins, and the titles of the six plugins
that get a new name: Gameboy, Paint, Blocks and Meteors (the other two have no
title to change). The puzzles platform file gets a neutral name, since its
name shows in assertion messages, and the game engines name their audio and
video drivers TacetOS.
